ework in  the development of new federated  learning efforts and we encourage the  research community to explore new  approaches using flute  for more information regarding to the  implementation please visit our  documentation  we also encourage you to check out our  paper in archive  finally read our latest post on the  microsoft research blog where you can  find more information about this project  you

